    "username": "DPM_PK",
    "text": "Deputy Prime Minister / Foreign Minister Senator Mohammad Ishaq Dar@MIshaqDar50along with Finance Minister Senator Muhammad Aurangzeb, held a  meeting today with senior leaders of the Pakistan Peoples Party as part of routine pre-budget consultations ahead of the Federal",
