  },
  {
    "id": "tweet_MIshaqDar50_-5005368466226890070",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "MIshaqDar50",
    "text": "Heartiest congratulations to my friend@larsloekkeon reassuming the office of Foreign Minister after the recent elections.\n\nIt has been a pleasure engaging with you through our meetings & telephone exchanges, and I deeply value the friendship and understanding we have developed",
    "translated_text": "衷心祝贺我的朋友@larsloekkeon 在最近的选举后重新担任外交部长职务。\n\n很高兴通过我们的会议和电话交流与您进行交流，我非常珍惜我们所建立的友谊和理解",
