    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "KellieMeyerNews",
    "text": "Tonight the Pentagon announced the death of an Active Duty Soldier who was supporting Operation Inherent Resolve.\n \nSergeant Devin A. Seibel, 26, of Robinson, Texas, died on May 31, 2026, in Erbil Airbase, Iraq, during a training-related incident. \n\nThe Soldier was assigned to",
    "translated_text": "今晚，五角大楼宣布一名支持“坚定决心”行动的现役士兵死亡。\n \n德克萨斯州罗宾逊市的 26 岁中士德文·塞贝尔 (Devin A. Seibel) 于 2026 年 5 月 31 日在伊拉克埃尔比勒空军基地的一次训练相关事件中死亡。 \n\n该士兵被分配到",
    "images": [],
